# game/case08.rpy:62
translate schinese press_reimu_1_06e07d27:

    # you "What exactly do the charms do?"
    you "这些护身符到底有什么用？"

# game/case08.rpy:63
translate schinese press_reimu_1_1d04c4b4:

    # reimu "Luck. General luck. All-purpose, everyday luck."
    reimu "运气。全面的运气。万用的日常运气。"

# game/case08.rpy:65
translate schinese press_reimu_1_48a22ace:

    # eiki "That is not a specification."
    eiki "这算不上说明。"

# game/case08.rpy:69
translate schinese press_reimu_2_53d7955f:

    # you "Fifty? Who's counting?"
    you "五十个？谁数的？"

# game/case08.rpy:71
translate schinese press_reimu_2_e6ebbfcf:

    # reimu "The donation box. It has never been this heavy."
    reimu "香火钱箱。它从来没这么重过。"

# game/case08.rpy:75
translate schinese press_reimu_3_86251bb5:

    # you "How do you know they work?"
    you "你怎么知道它们管用？"

# game/case08.rpy:76
translate schinese press_reimu_3_e63e3b45:

    # reimu "Weren't you listening? Put this in my testimony. In big letters."
    reimu "你没在听吗？把这句加进我的证词。用大字写。"

# game/case08.rpy:80
translate schinese press_reimu_4_be18741f:

    # you "Did anyone check whether the charm owners actually got luckier?"
    you "有人查过买了护身符的人是不是真的变幸运了吗？"

# game/case08.rpy:82
translate schinese press_reimu_4_eada9422:

    # reimu "Why would I check? Fifty people already checked. By paying."
    reimu "我干嘛要查？五十个人已经查过了。用付钱的方式。"

# game/case08.rpy:84
translate schinese press_reimu_4_21eecc84:

    # eiki "Paying is not checking."
    eiki "付钱不等于查证。"

# game/case08.rpy:95
translate schinese case8_3af4f096:

    # eiki "Order. The Higan Court of Logic is in session."
    eiki "肃静。彼岸逻辑法庭现在开庭。"

# game/case08.rpy:97
translate schinese case8_0d42250e:

    # eiki "Komachi."
    eiki "小町。"

# game/case08.rpy:98
translate schinese case8_cdc3345c:

    # komachi "Defendant's here, boss. She's selling charms in the waiting room."
    komachi "被告到了，四季大人。她在候审室卖护身符。"

# game/case08.rpy:99
translate schinese case8_ac34ad81:

    # eiki "Confiscate them."
    eiki "没收。"

# game/case08.rpy:100
translate schinese case8_24b6a586:

    # komachi "Bought three. Is my luck supposed to feel this ordinary?"
    komachi "买了三个。运气就该感觉这么普通吗？"

# game/case08.rpy:103
translate schinese case8_94da9e7a:

    # reimu "Reimu Hakurei, shrine maiden. Make it quick. The donation box doesn't fill itself."
    reimu "巫女博丽灵梦。快点。香火钱箱可不会自己装满。"

# game/case08.rpy:106
translate schinese case8_cd2b47c9:

    # eiki "The charge: selling lucky charms that do not work to half the Human Village."
    eiki "罪名：把不管用的护身符卖给了半个人类村落。"

# game/case08.rpy:109
translate schinese case8_a3a55d86:

    # reimu "They work. Ask anyone. Ask everyone."
    reimu "管用的。随便问谁。问所有人。"

# game/case08.rpy:113
translate schinese case8_f3b29ff0:

    # eiki "Junior Judge. A crowd can be loud. That does not make it right."
    eiki "见习法官。人群可以很吵，但吵不代表对。"

# game/case08.rpy:114
translate schinese case8_f5c5ac8c:

    # eiki "Count the votes if you like. Then go and check the facts anyway."
    eiki "想数票就数吧。数完还是得去查证事实。"

# game/case08.rpy:130
translate schinese case8_5ed7189e:

    # reimu_t "Last week I started selling Hakurei Lucky Charms. One hundred yen each."
    reimu_t "上周我开始卖博丽幸运护身符。一个一百日元。"

# game/case08.rpy:131
translate schinese case8_52a20e15:

    # reimu_t "Fifty villagers have bought one already. The rest are on a waiting list."
    reimu_t "已经有五十个村民买了。其他人在排队等。"

# game/case08.rpy:132
translate schinese case8_9b296754:

    # reimu_t "So there's no question about it. The charms work."
    reimu_t "所以毫无疑问。护身符管用。"

# game/case08.rpy:136
translate schinese case8_19f74238:

    # eiki "Your witness, Junior Judge. Keep your wallet in your pocket."
    eiki "证人交给你了，见习法官。把钱包收好。"

# game/case08.rpy:150
translate schinese case8_cross_3828e28d:

    # eiki "Again. Komachi, stop buying charms."
    eiki "再来一次。小町，别再买护身符了。"

# game/case08.rpy:161
translate schinese case8_breakthrough_aa714668:

    # you "Fifty people bought a charm. Not one of them got any luckier."
    you "五十个人买了护身符。没有一个人变得更幸运。"

# game/case08.rpy:162
translate schinese case8_breakthrough_cfe64044:

    # you "A crowd buying something proves it sells. It doesn't prove it works."
    you "很多人买，证明它好卖，证明不了它管用。"

# game/case08.rpy:165
translate schinese case8_breakthrough_61377ace:

    # reimu "...Twelve tripped? Nine got rained on? ...Do I have to give the money back?"
    reimu "……十二个摔跤？九个淋雨？……我得把钱还回去吗？"

# game/case08.rpy:169
translate schinese case8_breakthrough_11ca0f7e:

    # eiki "Bandwagon. An appeal to popularity. A crowd of believers does not make a claim true."
    eiki "从众谬误。诉诸人气。信的人再多，也不能让一个说法变成真的。"

# game/case08.rpy:170
translate schinese case8_breakthrough_abb5e208:

    # eiki "Everyone once agreed the earth was flat. The earth did not take a vote."
    eiki "人们曾一致认为大地是平的。大地可没参加投票。"

# game/case08.rpy:177
translate schinese case8_breakthrough_516fedff:

    # eiki "Defendant Reimu Hakurei. This court finds you..."
    eiki "被告博丽灵梦。本庭判决你……"

# game/case08.rpy:188
translate schinese case8_breakthrough_5114fdbb:

    # eiki "Sentence: refund every charm. From the donation box."
    eiki "判决：所有护身符全额退款。从香火钱箱里出。"

# game/case08.rpy:191
translate schinese case8_breakthrough_8e63a634:

    # reimu "The donation box?! That's the cruellest sentence this court has ever passed."
    reimu "从香火钱箱里？！这是本庭有史以来最残忍的判决。"

# game/case08.rpy:194
translate schinese case8_breakthrough_92179ff4:

    # komachi "Can I keep mine, boss? I've grown attached."
    komachi "我那几个能留着吗，四季大人？我已经有感情了。"

# game/case08.rpy:195
translate schinese case8_breakthrough_6063f5e0:

    # eiki "Bailiff."
    eiki "法警。"

# game/case08.rpy:196
translate schinese case8_breakthrough_ce8461be:

    # komachi "On it, boss."
    komachi "这就去，四季大人。"

# game/case08.rpy:208
translate schinese case8_breakthrough_5ea610dd:

    # eiki "The shrine maiden of paradise, on a refund schedule. Court is adjourned."
    eiki "乐园的巫女，开始分期退款。退庭。"

# game/case08.rpy:209
translate schinese case8_breakthrough_11e232a7:

    # komachi "A first for the Hakurei Shrine, boss. Money going out."
    komachi "博丽神社破天荒头一回，四季大人。钱居然往外流。"

translate schinese strings:

    # game/case08.rpy:10
    old "Hakurei Lucky Charm"
    new "博丽幸运护身符"

    # game/case08.rpy:10
    old "A red pouch. Inside, a slip of paper with one word on it: \"luck.\""
    new "红色小袋。里面有张纸条，只写了一个字：“运”。"

    # game/case08.rpy:12
    old "Donation Box (Full)"
    new "香火钱箱（满）"

    # game/case08.rpy:12
    old "Heavy, for once. Five thousand yen and a button."
    new "难得这么重。五千日元和一颗纽扣。"

    # game/case08.rpy:14
    old "Village Complaint List"
    new "村落投诉清单"

    # game/case08.rpy:14
    old "Charm owners this week: 12 tripped, 9 rained on, 3 bitten by fairies. Lucky: none."
    new "本周护身符持有者：12人摔跤，9人淋雨，3人被妖精咬。走运的：0人。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "Fifty Satisfied Customers"
    new "五十位满意的顾客"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "Last week I started selling Hakurei Lucky Charms. One hundred yen each."
    new "上周我开始卖博丽幸运护身符。一个一百日元。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "A price list is not an argument. Though it is an expensive one."
    new "价目表不是论证。虽然是份很贵的价目表。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "Fifty villagers have bought one already. The rest are on a waiting list."
    new "已经有五十个村民买了。其他人在排队等。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "Sales are a fact. Look for what she concludes from them."
    new "销量是事实。看她从中得出了什么结论。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "So there's no question about it. The charms work."
    new "所以毫无疑问。护身符管用。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "No question? Ask her one. Press before you object."
    new "毫无疑问？那就问她一个。反对之前先追问。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "Fifty people bought one. Fifty people can't all be wrong."
    new "五十个人都买了。五十个人不可能都错。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "Close. But she isn't leaning on one expert. She's leaning on a crowd."
    new "接近了。但她依靠的不是一位专家，而是一群人。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "That would be one example turned into a rule. She has fifty examples of buying, and none of testing."
    new "那是把一个例子变成规律。她有五十个购买的例子，却没有一个检验的例子。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "She isn't mixing up order and cause. She's counting customers as if they were results."
    new "她没有混淆先后和因果。她是把顾客数当成了效果来数。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "She isn't attacking anyone. She's hiding behind a headcount."
    new "她没攻击任何人。她是躲在人数背后。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "Nobody's being blamed in return. The crowd itself is her argument."
    new "没人被反过来指责。人群本身就是她的论据。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "No chain of disasters. Just fifty people and one bad conclusion."
    new "没有灾难连锁。只有五十个人和一个糟糕的结论。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "No either-or here. Just a popularity contest pretending to be proof."
    new "这里没有非此即彼。只有一场假装成证据的人气投票。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "Her reason isn't her conclusion. Her reason is the size of the queue."
    new "她的理由不是她的结论。她的理由是队伍的长度。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "She isn't twisting anyone's words. She's counting heads instead of results."
    new "她没歪曲谁的话。她数的是人头，不是效果。"

    # game/case08.rpy:17
    old "That doesn't show whether the charms work. Find out what happened to the people who bought them."
    new "这证明不了护身符是否管用。查查买了的人后来怎么样了。"

